  'Hong Kong, Tokyo, London, Frankfurt and other listed markets use their home exchange book when your IBKR account has that data.': '如你的 IBKR 帳戶有相關數據，香港、東京、倫敦、法蘭克福等市場會使用其本地交易所的買賣盤。',
  'OpenD host · port': 'OpenD 主機 · 埠', '(API port, default 11111)': '（API 埠，預設 11111）',
  'Run Futu OpenD (or moomoo OpenD) and log in there; your Futu login stays in OpenD and the app never sees it. Covers Hong Kong, US, Shanghai/Shenzhen (Stock Connect) and Singapore books that your Futu quote rights include (HK depth needs LV2). If OpenD has RSA encryption switched on, switch it off: the app talks to it on this PC only.': '執行富途 OpenD（或 moomoo OpenD）並在那裏登入；你的富途登入資料只留在 OpenD，程式不會看到。涵蓋你的富途報價權限所包括的香港、美國、滬深（港股通／滬深股通）及新加坡買賣盤（港股深度需要 LV2）。如 OpenD 開啟了 RSA 加密，請關閉：程式只在本機與它通訊。',
  'Longbridge app key': '長橋 App Key', 'App secret': 'App Secret', 'Access token': 'Access Token',
  'Hong Kong, US, Shanghai/Shenzhen and Singapore books, as far as your Longbridge quote level allows. Access tokens expire (you set how long when you make one); paste a new one here when it does.': '在你的長橋報價級別許可範圍內，提供香港、美國、滬深及新加坡買賣盤。Access Token 會過期（建立時可設定期限）；過期時請在這裏貼上新的。',
  'Tiger ID · licence': 'Tiger ID · 牌照', 'TBHK (Hong Kong)': 'TBHK（香港）', 'TBSG (Singapore)': 'TBSG（新加坡）', 'TBNZ (New Zealand)': 'TBNZ（新西蘭）', 'TBAU (Australia)': 'TBAU（澳洲）', 'TBUS (US)': 'TBUS（美國）',
  'Private key': '私鑰', 'Token': '令牌', '(TBHK accounts only)': '（只限 TBHK 帳戶）',
  'US, Hong Kong, China A and Singapore books your Tiger quote permissions include. The app never asks for your account number or trading password.': '你的老虎報價權限所包括的美國、香港、A 股及新加坡買賣盤。程式永遠不會要求你的帳戶號碼或交易密碼。',
  'Schwab app key': 'Schwab App Key', 'Callback URL': '回調網址', '(must match your Schwab app exactly)': '（必須與你的 Schwab App 完全相同）', 'Sign in': '登入', '1. Open Schwab sign-in': '1. 開啟 Schwab 登入頁',
  'Connect': '連接', 'Sign out': '登出', 'Remove keys': '移除金鑰',
  'Nasdaq and NYSE books from Schwab\'s streamer (US stocks only). Schwab makes you sign in again every 7 days. After sign-in the browser shows an error page at 127.0.0.1; that\'s expected, copy its address.': '來自 Schwab 串流的納斯達克及紐約證交所買賣盤（只限美股）。Schwab 每 7 日要求重新登入一次。登入後瀏覽器會在 127.0.0.1 顯示錯誤頁面，這是正常的，複製該網址即可。',
  'Direct exchange feeds (US stocks)': '交易所直接數據（美股）', 'When one is set, it replaces the broker\'s book for US stocks it covers; the broker above stays the fallback and still covers other markets.': '設定後，它會取代券商在其涵蓋美股的買賣盤；上面的券商仍作後備，並繼續涵蓋其他市場。',
  'Off': '關閉', '(NYSE\'s depth feed)': '（紐約證交所的深度數據）',
  'TotalView covers every stock that trades on Nasdaq, including NYSE-listed ones; OpenBook is used for NYSE-listed stocks. Nasdaq\'s and NYSE\'s own feeds are licensed to firms (Nasdaq Cloud Data Service is a Kafka stream that needs a Nasdaq data agreement), so the app reads the same exchange data through Databento, which licenses it per user and bills by data used. A TotalView subscription you already have at IBKR works through IBKR → Nasdaq TotalView above.': 'TotalView 涵蓋所有在納斯達克買賣的股票，包括在紐約證交所上市的；OpenBook 用於紐約證交所上市股票。納斯達克及紐約證交所本身的數據只授權予機構（Nasdaq Cloud Data Service 是需要簽署納斯達克數據協議的 Kafka 串流），所以程式透過 Databento 讀取相同的交易所數據，Databento 按用戶授權並按數據用量收費。如你已在 IBKR 訂閱 TotalView，可透過上面的 IBKR → Nasdaq TotalView 使用。',
  'Save': '儲存', 'Keys are encrypted with your Windows account and only used by the app\'s background process; the page never sees them. Yahoo data comes from unofficial endpoints and can change without notice.': '金鑰以你的 Windows 帳戶加密，只供程式的後台程序使用；頁面永遠看不到。Yahoo 數據來自非官方接口，可能隨時更改而不另行通知。',
  'Open the folder that holds settings.json (keys are inside, encrypted)': '開啟存放 settings.json 的資料夾（金鑰已加密存放於內）', 'Delete every saved API key and broker sign-in from this PC': '從本機刪除所有已儲存的 API 金鑰及券商登入',
  'Back to the market overview and forget the loaded picks.json': '回到市場概覽並忘記已載入的 picks.json', 'Paste key, then Save (stored encrypted on this PC)': '貼上金鑰後按儲存（在本機加密存放）', 'Check the saved key with FMP': '向 FMP 檢查已儲存的金鑰',
  'Paste key (stored encrypted on this PC)': '貼上金鑰（在本機加密存放）', 'sk-ant-… (stored encrypted on this PC)': 'sk-ant-…（在本機加密存放）', 'List the models this key can use': '列出這個金鑰可用的模型',
  'Check Ollama and the installed models': '檢查 Ollama 及已安裝的模型', 'from open.longbridge.com → Developers': '來自 open.longbridge.com → 開發者', 'the RSA private key from the Tiger developer page': '老虎開發者頁面上的 RSA 私鑰',
  'from developer.schwab.com → Apps': '來自 developer.schwab.com → Apps', '2. paste the address the browser lands on': '2. 貼上瀏覽器最後停留的網址', 'Databento API key db-…': 'Databento API 金鑰 db-…',
  'Databento API key (can be the same key)': 'Databento API 金鑰（可用同一個金鑰）', 'e.g. C:\\Python312\\python.exe': '例如 C:\\Python312\\python.exe', 'e.g. C:\\w64devkit\\bin\\gcc.exe': '例如 C:\\w64devkit\\bin\\gcc.exe',
  '● Windows secure storage is not available,': '● Windows 安全儲存不可用，',
  'so keys you enter are kept in memory only, never written to disk, and forgotten when the app closes. Keys are decrypted only inside the app\'s background process, never shown in the window, written to logs or included in exports, and each key is sent only to the service it belongs to.': '所以你輸入的金鑰只保存在記憶體，不會寫入磁碟，並會在程式關閉時忘記。金鑰只在程式的後台程序內解密，永遠不會在視窗顯示、寫入記錄或包含在匯出檔案中，而每個金鑰只會傳送到其所屬的服務。',
  'Keys are decrypted only inside the app\'s background process, never shown in the window, written to logs or included in exports, and each key is sent only to the service it belongs to.': '金鑰只在程式的後台程序內解密，永遠不會在視窗顯示、寫入記錄或包含在匯出檔案中，而每個金鑰只會傳送到其所屬的服務。',
